{"id":"en_delivered-to-the-wrong-address","title":"Delivered to the wrong address","titleEn":"Delivered to the wrong address","description":"Marcus uncovers that his wife Audrey and her lover Ethan have been siphoning money from the company. Rather than seeking payback, he quietly collects proof and brings them before a court on fraud charges. For the sake of her parents, he also puts his signature to a letter of understanding. He then reorganizes the business, starts a new family life, and steps out of the shadows—composed rather than resentful, and at last free. Those interested can follow the series on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/delivered-to-the-wrong-address/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/delivered-to-the-wrong-address/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Coporate Warfare","Karma Payback","Legal Justice","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dexk2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_delivered-to-the-wrong-address_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dexk2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_delivered-to-the-wrong-address_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dexk2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_delivered-to-the-wrong-address_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dexk2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_delivered-to-the-wrong-address_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed